WEBVTT

00:03:27.190 --> 00:03:30.200
and even visited remote villages.

00:03:31.140 --> 00:03:35.210
I personally met with people
from all walks of life --

00:03:35.220 --> 00:03:38.230
mayors, NGOs, schoolchildren,

00:03:38.240 --> 00:03:42.000
politicians, militiamen,

00:03:42.010 --> 00:03:44.230
people from mosques, churches,

00:03:44.240 --> 00:03:48.080
the president of the country,
even housewives.

00:03:49.130 --> 00:03:52.060
I learned one thing:

00:03:52.070 --> 00:03:55.140
When you walk the talk,
people believe you.

00:03:56.180 --> 00:04:00.170
Many were touched by my personal story,